      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "How the library gets there",
      "items": [
        "Pick the largest element off the diagonal and turn the two rows and columns it joins",
        "The smaller of the two angles that would clear it is taken, because it disturbs least",
        "When nothing is left off the diagonal, the diagonal holds the amounts"
